cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the HCLS AI Factory, please cite it."
title: "HCLS AI Factory"
abstract: >-
  An open-source precision-medicine platform: 8 compute engines, 8 clinical
  intelligence agents, and the flagship Tuberous Sclerosis Complex disease
  program. From a patient's raw DNA toward a shortlist of therapeutic candidates
  in hours, on a single NVIDIA DGX Spark, bursting heavy work to remote GPUs over
  a private mesh. Decision support for a qualified clinician, never autonomous
  diagnosis.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jones
    given-names: Adam
repository-code: "https://github.com/ajones1923/hcls-ai-factory"
url: "https://hcls-ai-factory.org"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - precision medicine
  - genomics
  - clinical decision support
  - drug discovery
  - open source
